cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the original paper."
title: "pi-arc — Addressable Recall Compaction for Pi"
abstract: >-
  An original, independent TypeScript implementation of Addressable Recall
  Compaction (ARC) for the Pi agent ecosystem, implementing the technique
  described in "Addressable Recall Compaction for Long Context-Window Control
  in AI Agents" (arXiv:2607.25066). Lossless compression via an append-only,
  ID-addressable archive with on-demand recall. No third-party source code was
  copied, forked, or adapted.
